{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>For these two years has the famine been in the midst of the land</b> — He reminded them of what had passed, and they too knew to say that the land through which they had traveled had been two years in famine, and they had consumed everything that was in their possession, and grain had become extremely expensive, and five more years would yet pass over them; there would be no sustenance for you in it at all if HaShem had not sent me before you."], :book :genesis, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 45, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T03:44:53.601981168Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}